 "texts": [
  {
   "id": "mvxwdf8bcp",
   "x": -60,
   "y": 200,
   "text": "* HR = heart rate (bpm), used by sheet 1-body\n.param HR=72\n.tran 0.5m 6 0 0.5m\n.ac dec 50 10m 1k\n* gear: the 0.5 ms step is far longer than the LED node's ~0.4 µs time constant,\n* which makes the default trapezoidal method ring (±11 mV, sign flips every step)\n.options method=gear"
  },
  {
   "id": "mvxwdf8bcq",
   "x": -60,
   "y": 330,
   "text": "* plotted on Run, one chart per line; text after ; is its title. xdet.qrs = net qrs inside block XDET\n.plot tran v(la,ra) ; Electrodes: lead I (LA − RA) at the skin\n.plot tran v(ina) v(ecg) ; Amplified: instrumentation amp (×11) and 0.5–40 Hz band (×1111)\n.plot tran v(xdet.qrs) v(xdet.thr) v(tmr) ; Detection: QRS vs threshold, 150 ms one-shot\n.plot tran I(XLED.D1) v(xled.led_a,xled.led_k) ; LED current and voltage\n.plot ac v(ina) v(ecg) v(xdet.qrs) ; Frequency response: gain from the electrodes (1 V AC, lead I)"
  },
  {
   "id": "mvxwdf8bcr",
   "x": -60,
   "y": 450,
   "text": "* detected rate from the one-shot (0.833 s = 72 bpm)\n.meas tran beat TRIG v(tmr) VAL=0 FALL=2 TARG v(tmr) VAL=0 FALL=3"
  }
 ],
 "draw": [],
 "buses": []
